Sections.Body:
| Event Name | Producer | Consumer(s) | JSON Schema (Payload) | Communication Protocol |
| :--------- | :------- | :---------- | :-------------------- | :--------------------- |
| `AIML_Inference_Request` | Azure Application (e.g., AKS App) | Secondary Hyperscaler AI Model API | `{
  'type': 'object',
  'properties': {
    'request_id': { 'type': 'string' },
    'model_id': { 'type': 'string' },
    'input_data': { 'type': 'object' },
    'callback_url': { 'type': 'string', 'format': 'uri' }
  },
  'required': ['request_id', 'model_id', 'input_data']
}` | Azure Event Hubs / Kafka |
| `AIML_Inference_Result` | Secondary Hyperscaler AI Model API | Azure Application (e.g., AKS App), Azure Data Lake | `{
  'type': 'object',
  'properties': {
    'request_id': { 'type': 'string' },
    'model_id': { 'type': 'string' },
    'output_data': { 'type': 'object' },
    'status': { 'type': 'string', 'enum': ['SUCCESS', 'FAILED'] },
    'error_message': { 'type': 'string' }
  },
  'required': ['request_id', 'model_id', 'output_data', 'status']
}` | Azure Event Hubs / Kafka |
| `Data_Ingestion_Event` | Azure Data Ingestion Service | Secondary Hyperscaler Data Processing Pipeline | `{
  'type': 'object',
  'properties': {
    'batch_id': { 'type': 'string' },
    'source_system': { 'type': 'string' },
    'data_location': { 'type': 'string', 'format': 'uri' },
    'timestamp': { 'type': 'string', 'format': 'date-time' }
  },
  'required': ['batch_id', 'source_system', 'data_location', 'timestamp']
}` | Azure Event Hubs / SQS / GCP Pub/Sub |
| `Identity_Sync_Event` | Azure Active Directory (via sync tool) | Secondary Hyperscaler Identity Provider | `{
  'type': 'object',
  'properties': {
    'user_id': { 'type': 'string' },
    'email': { 'type': 'string', 'format': 'email' },
    'roles': { 'type': 'array', 'items': { 'type': 'string' } },
    'action': { 'type': 'string', 'enum': ['CREATE', 'UPDATE', 'DELETE'] }
  },
  'required': ['user_id', 'email', 'roles', 'action']
}` | Azure Event Grid / SQS / GCP Pub/Sub |
